        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek Topeka Handleset Interior Trim Only</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is the interior trim for Emtek Sandacst Bronze Handlesets including the <a href=\"/products/topeka-mortise-handleset-emtek-3322\">Topeka</a>, Cheyenne, and Denver. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Emtek Arched Interior Trim for Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Height: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-13/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-5/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold as Interior Trim Only.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arched Sandcast Bronze Interior Trim Mortise Handlese",
                "description": "This is the interior trim for Emtek Sandacst Bronze Handlesets including the Topeka, Cheyenne, and Denver. Sandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.",
